{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/062b56f88769d91403e585c6165eca59.poster.avif?t=1753232393\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/062b56f88769d91403e585c6165eca59.webm?t=1753232393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/062b56f88769d91403e585c6165eca59.mp4?t=1753232393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An Arab man has one request: make the ultimate Dubai chocolate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b]In Dubai Chocolate Simulator, you take on a series of bizarre yet hilarious challenges to collect the ingredients for a one-of-a-kind chocolate. From boxing rings to racetracks, every mission brings you closer to crafting the legendary treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b]You\u2019ll earn gold by boxing, win pistachio cream through horse racing, conquer obstacle courses to get cocoa, defeat enemies on a farm to collect pistachios Once all ingredients are gathered, it\u2019s time to combine them and deliver your handcrafted Dubai chocolate to the man who started it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b]This game blends humor, action, and simple mechanics into a fun and fast-paced simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b]<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/8117f3f86ca00ed1778b3b85bed28d4b.poster.avif?t=1753232393\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/8117f3f86ca00ed1778b3b85bed28d4b.webm?t=1753232393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/8117f3f86ca00ed1778b3b85bed28d4b.mp4?t=1753232393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b]Complete five wild missions, each with a unique gameplay style</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b]Collect real ingredients like cocoa, pistachio cream, tahini, and more</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b]Switch between fighting, racing, platforming, and driving</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b]Craft your own Dubai chocolate in the final step</p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b]A short, quirky, and satisfying journey with a flavorful twist</p></strong></li></ul><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/b]Do you have what it takes to fulfill the mission and satisfy the chocolate master?</p></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812310?t=1753232393","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/687e2114b8b790f8b7c6f20fa27c5fb5cf7e5653/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753232393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/94af49a83729bc6b26cafcc626c85c9d01709ac1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753232393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/94af49a83729bc6b26cafcc626c85c9d01709ac1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753232393","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812310/extras/062b56f88769d91403e585c6165eca59.poster.avif?t=175323